0 v\u1ea5n ban \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch v\u00e0 tri\u1ec3n khai d\u1ef1 \u00e1n. Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh ch\u00f3ng, th\u00f4ng tin r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng gi\u00fap ch\u00fang t\u00f4i ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n y\u00ean t\u00e2m khi l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c c\u00f9ng h\u1ecd.\n\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, s\u1ef1 uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 cam k\u1ebft tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1edbi deadline c\u1ee7a Nextcore l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt. Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn anh T\u00fa, Project Manager c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ed9i, ng\u01b0\u1eddi lu\u00f4n t\u1eadn t\u00e2m t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nhi\u1ec7t t\u00ecnh, mang \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi.\nNextcore kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady tr\u00ean h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i!","name":"C\u00f4ng ty An T\u00e2m Vi\u1ec7t","title":"D\u1ef1 \u00e1n Plugin Affiliate","image":{"id":1678,"url":"https:\/\/staging.nextcore.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/logo-footer-2048x509-2.png","alt":"","source":"library","size":""},"_id":"743a26d"},{"content":"Ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c nhanh v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng. Nhi\u1ec7t t\u00ecnh h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 sau khi ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c","name":"Ph\u1ea1m Vi\u1ec7t H\u00f9ng","title":"D\u1ef1 \u00e1n T\u1ea1o template ebook","image":{"id":1668,"url":"https:\/\/staging.nextcore.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/03-512.webp","alt":"","source":"library","size":""},"_id":"be9200d"},{"content":"C\u00f4ng ty Ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m Next Core l\u00e0m d\u1ef1 \u00e1n c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i r\u1ea5t chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00fang y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c s\u1edbm h\u01a1n th\u1eddi gian quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.\nC\u00e1c b\u1ea1n dev c\u1ee7a C\u00f4ng ty h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u00f4i r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec7t t\u00ecnh trong th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i.\nHighly recommend cho c\u00e1c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c IT, ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m, design.","name":"Nguy\u1ec5n Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng Tr\u00e0 My","title":"D\u1ef1 \u00e1n Convert nghi\u1ec7p v\u1ee5 sang s\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 kh\u1ed1i","image":{"id":1672,"url":"https:\/\/staging.nextcore.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/91649367-profil-der-jungen-frau-cartoon-symbol-vektor-illustration-grafik-design.jpg","alt":"","source":"library","size":""},"_id":"b04530f"},{"_id":"5d08f7d","content":"Highly appreciate your working spirit.\nI am pleased to choose you as partners.\nWe will continue to cooperate in the future when there are new projects.","image":{"url":"https:\/\/staging.nextcore.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/ybadien-tu.png","id":1679,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"name":"B\u00e9 kh\u1ecfe b\u00e9 vui","title":"D\u1ef1 \u00e1n ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i website b\u1ecb t\u1ea5n c\u00f4ng"}],"layout":"image_stacked","show_arrows":"","content_color":"#000000","content_typography_typography":"custom","content_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"content_typography_font_weight":"200","name_color":"#DB0707","name_typography_typography":"custom","name_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"title_color":"#000000","image_border_radius":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"pagination_color_inactive":"#FFC3C3","pagination_color":"#DB0707","_background_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"_background_position":"center right","_background_attachment":"scroll","_background_repeat":"no-repeat","lazyload":"yes","content_typography_font_style":"italic","text_stroke_text_stroke_type":"yes","text_stroke_text_stroke":{"unit":"